e, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 3160, "text": "<b> Five Currant Buns </b> <br> </br>\nFIVE currant buns in a baker's shop, <br> </br>\nRound and fat with a cherry on top. <br> </br>\nAlong came a boy with a penny one day, <br> </br>\nBought a currant bun and took it away.  <I> (take a bun away) </I> <br> </br> <br> </br>\nFOUR currant buns in a baker's shop, <br> </br>\nRound and fat with a cherry on top. <br> </br>\nAlong came a girl with a penny one day, <br> </br>\nBought a currant bun and took it away. <I> (take a bun away) </I> <br> </br> <br> </br>\nTHREE currant buns in a baker's shop, <br> </br>\nRound and fat with a cherry on top. <br> </br>\nAlong came a boy with a penny one day, <br> </br>\nBought a currant bun and took it away. <I> (take a bun away) </I><br> </br> <br> </br>\nTWO currant buns in a baker's shop, <br> </br>\nRound and fat with a cherry on top. <br> </br>\nAlong came a girl with a penny one day, <br> </br>\nBought a currant bun and took it away. <I> (take a bun away) </I> <br> </br> <br> </br>\nONE currant bun in a baker's shop, <br> </br>\nRound and fat with a cherry on top. <br> </br>\nAlong came a boy with a penny one day, <br> </br>\nBought a currant bun and took it away. <br> </br>\nBought a currant bun and took it away! <I> (take a bun away) </I> <br> </br> <br> </br>\nRepeat the song to learn it with your child.\n\n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 5, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": "img_step_picture_03160.png", "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 2305, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": null, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "